VALUES (10191, 'tt0892769', NULL, 'How to Train Your Dragon', 'How to Train Your Dragon', 'movie', 2010, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygGmAO60t8GyqUo9xYeYxSZAR3b.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/59vDC1BuEQvti24OMr0ZvtAK6R1.jpg', 'As the son of a Viking leader on the cusp of manhood, shy Hiccup Horrendous Haddock III faces a rite of passage: he must kill a dragon to prove his warrior mettle. But after downing a feared dragon, he realizes that he no longer wants to destroy it, and instead befriends the beast – which he names Toothless – much to the chagrin of his warrior father.', NULL, NULL, 22.5039, 7.866, 0, 9.02, '2026-08-12 02:31:31', '2026-10-21 05:03:47')
